## 9. Styling Approach

Use Angular Material with a custom dark theme that matches the screenshots:

```scss
// Custom theme
$smart-home-primary: mat.define-palette(mat.$blue-palette, 500);
$smart-home-accent: mat.define-palette(mat.$cyan-palette, A200);
$smart-home-warn: mat.define-palette(mat.$red-palette);

$smart-home-theme: mat.define-dark-theme(
  (
    color: (
      primary: $smart-home-primary,
      accent: $smart-home-accent,
      warn: $smart-home-warn,
    ),
    typography: mat.define-typography-config(),
    density: 0,
  )
);

// Apply the theme
@include mat.all-component-themes($smart-home-theme);

// Custom styles for cards
.card {
  background-color: #1e1e1e;
  border-radius: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

// Active device styling
